# 约定(2026-09-23 重写, 对齐 api/payment/v1 的 proto):
#   直连 = http://{host}:{port}, 身份由 x-md-global-user-id 头模拟网关注入;
#   网关 = {gateway_scheme}://{gateway_host}(LAN) 或 https://{public_gateway_host}(公网), 带 Authorization: Bearer {token}。
#   变量在 http-client.env.json(dev)。host 用 [::1]: 127.0.0.1:30001/30002/30003 被 GoLand/WebStorm/JCEF 占着。

### healthz
POST http://{{host}}:{{port}}/healthz
Content-Type: application/json

### CreatePayment(写 dev 库; orderId 是 orders.order_main.id; freezeId/版本号是钱包冻结与乐观锁, 直连时给占位值)
POST http://{{host}}:{{port}}/payment.v1.PaymentService/CreatePayment
Content-Type: application/json
x-md-global-user-id: {{user_id}}

{
  "orderId": 1,
  "customerId": "{{user_id}}",
  "amount": "0.01",
  "currency": "CNY",
  "subject": "http-client 测试支付",
  "returnUrl": "https://shop.apikv.com/pay/return",
  "freezeId": 1,
  "customerVersion": 0,
  "merchantVersions": [0]
}

> {% if (response.body.paymentId) client.global.set("payment_id", response.body.paymentId); %}

### GetPaymentStatus
POST http://{{host}}:{{port}}/payment.v1.PaymentService/GetPaymentStatus
Content-Type: application/json
x-md-global-user-id: {{user_id}}

{"paymentId": {{payment_id}}}

### HandlePaymentNotify(支付宝异步通知; 假签名预期被拒, 用来验证验签路径)
POST http://{{host}}:{{port}}/payment.v1.PaymentService/HandlePaymentNotify
Content-Type: application/json

{"key": "out_trade_no", "values": ["{{order_no}}"]}

### HandlePaymentCallback(同步回跳; 假签名预期被拒)
POST http://{{host}}:{{port}}/payment.v1.PaymentService/HandlePaymentCallback
Content-Type: application/json

{"outTradeNo": "{{order_no}}", "tradeNo": "fake", "totalAmount": "0.01", "tradeStatus": "TRADE_SUCCESS", "sign": "fake", "signType": "RSA2", "appId": "fake", "timestamp": "2026-09-23 00:00:00"}
